75173>>>>>>>//
75173>>>>>>>// Command to set the owner of a Btrieve file.
75173>>>>>>>// File must have been opened.
75173>>>>>>>// Filenumber needs to be passed.
75173>>>>>>>// To clear set the owner to "".
75173>>>>>>>// Examples:
75173>>>>>>>//      DFBTR_SET_OWNER MyFileNumber to "Secret"
75173>>>>>>>//      DFBTR_SET_OWNER MyFileNumber to "Secret" READONLY CALLBACK MyCallBack
