75403>>>>>>>    Function EnumerateServers Returns Integer
75405>>>>>>>        
75405>>>>>>>        Integer iNumServers
75405>>>>>>>        Integer iNetworkLocal
75405>>>>>>>        
75405>>>>>>>        Move 0 to iNetworkLocal // 0 = enumerate network servers
75406>>>>>>>        
