75552>>>>>//    This function reads the current username Of windows and returns that
75552>>>>>//    name or an text unknown user
75552>>>>>Function Network_User_Name for cDesktop Returns String
75554>>>>>    WString wName
75554>>>>>    Integer iRetval iLength
75554>>>>>    
75554>>>>>    Move 0 to iLength
75555>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (0, 0, AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
75556>>>>>    Move (ZeroString(iLength)) to wName
75557>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (0, AddressOf (wName), AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
75558>>>>>    
75558>>>>>    If (iRetval = NO_ERROR) Begin
75560>>>>>        Function_Return (CString (wName))
75561>>>>>    End
75561>>>>>>
75561>>>>>    
75561>>>>>    Function_Return "User Unknown"
75562>>>>>End_Function
