75716>>>>>            If (hoWorkspace <> 0) Begin
75718>>>>>                Send EnumerateWorkspaceData of hoWorkspace Self (Refproc (AppendTextLn))
75719>>>>>                Send AppendTextLn ""
75720>>>>>            End
75720>>>>>>
75720>>>>>        End
75720>>>>>>
75720>>>>>    End_Procedure
75721>>>>>    
75721>>>>>    // If connection ids are used, we will send the message EnumerateConnections
