76125>>>>>    //  Validates if the field contains a valid email address (it allows empty values too).
76125>>>>>    Function ValidateEmail Integer iColumn String sValue Returns Boolean
76127>>>>>        Integer iAt iDot
76127>>>>>        Boolean bResult
76127>>>>>        
76127>>>>>        If (Trim(sValue) <> "") Begin
76129>>>>>            Move (Pos("@", sValue)) to iAt
76130>>>>>            Move (RightPos(".", sValue)) to iDot
76131>>>>>            
76131>>>>>            If (not(iAt > 1 and iDot > 0 and iDot > iAt + 1 and iDot < Length(sValue))) Begin
76133>>>>>                Send Data_set_error iColumn DFERR_OPERATOR "Please enter a valid email address"
76134>>>>>                Move True to bResult
76135>>>>>            End
76135>>>>>>
76135>>>>>        End
76135>>>>>>
76135>>>>>        
76135>>>>>        Function_Return bResult
76136>>>>>    End_Function
76137>>>>>    
