77437>>>>>    // Add a default date if the field is blank
77437>>>>>    Procedure Entry_Order_Date Integer iField Date dDate
77439>>>>>        Integer iChanged
77439>>>>>        
77439>>>>>        Get Field_Changed_State iField to iChanged
77440>>>>>        If (iChanged=0 and dDate=0) Begin
77442>>>>>            Sysdate dDate
77443>>>>>            Set Field_Default_Value iField to dDate
77444>>>>>        End
77444>>>>>>
77444>>>>>    End_Procedure
