78249>>>>>>>    Procedure DFSetMargins Number nLeft Number nTop Number nRight Number nBottom
78251>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
78251>>>>>>>        Integer iLeft iRight iTop iBottom
78251>>>>>>>        
78251>>>>>>>        Move (nLeft   * 100) to iLeft
78252>>>>>>>        Move (nRight  * 100) to iRight
78253>>>>>>>        Move (nTop    * 100) to iTop
78254>>>>>>>        Move (nBottom * 100) to iBottom
78255>>>>>>>        
78255>>>>>>>        Move (WP_SetMargins(iLeft,iTop,iRight,iBottom)) to bOk
78256>>>>>>>        
78256>>>>>>>        If bOk Begin
78258>>>>>>>            Set DFLeft_Margin   to nLeft
78259>>>>>>>            Set DFTop_Margin    to nTop
78260>>>>>>>            Set DFRight_Margin  to nRight
78261>>>>>>>            Set DFBottom_Margin to nBottom
78262>>>>>>>        End
78262>>>>>>>>
78262>>>>>>>        Else Begin
78263>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_WINPRINT DFPrintError911
78264>>>>>>>>
78264>>>>>>>        End
78264>>>>>>>>
78264>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
78265>>>>>>>    
78265>>>>>>>    
