78265>>>>>>>    Procedure DFSetLeftMargin Number nLeft
78267>>>>>>>        Number  nTop nRight nBottom
78267>>>>>>>        Get DFTop_Margin    to nTop
78268>>>>>>>        Get DFRight_Margin  to nRight
78269>>>>>>>        Get DFBottom_Margin to nBottom
78270>>>>>>>        Send DFSetMargins nLeft nTop nRight nBottom
78271>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
