78705>>>>>>>    Function DFGetCurrentDevice Returns String
78707>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
78707>>>>>>>        WString  sDFStr
78707>>>>>>>        Pointer pDFStr
78707>>>>>>>        
78707>>>>>>>        Move (Repeat( Character(0), 255 )) to sDFStr
78708>>>>>>>        Move (AddressOf(sDFStr)) to pDFStr
78709>>>>>>>        
78709>>>>>>>        Move (WP_GetCurrentDevice(pDFStr)) to bOk
78710>>>>>>>        
78710>>>>>>>        If not bOk Begin
78712>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_WINPRINT DFPrintError959
78713>>>>>>>>
78713>>>>>>>        End
78713>>>>>>>>
78713>>>>>>>        
78713>>>>>>>        Move (CString(sDFStr)) to sDFStr
78714>>>>>>>        Function_Return sDFStr
78715>>>>>>>    End_Function
