78755>>>>>>>    // To be set in CM
78755>>>>>>>    Procedure DFSetUserDefinedPapersize Number nLength Number nWidth
78757>>>>>>>        Integer bOk
78757>>>>>>>        Integer iLength iWidth iSize
78757>>>>>>>        
78757>>>>>>>        Move (nLength*100) to iLength
78758>>>>>>>        Move (nWidth*100)  to iWidth
78759>>>>>>>        Move ((iLength*65536)+iWidth) to iSize
78760>>>>>>>        
78760>>>>>>>        Move (WP_SetUserDefinedPapersize(iSize)) to bOk
78761>>>>>>>        
78761>>>>>>>        If not bOk Begin
78763>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_WINPRINT DFPrintError964
78764>>>>>>>>
78764>>>>>>>        End
78764>>>>>>>>
78764>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
