78828>>>>>>>    
78828>>>>>>>    // internal function, used to extract different printer flags ranges based on
78828>>>>>>>    // the print flag integer. These flags use a decimal style of packing information
78828>>>>>>>    // where different printer options (paper, bin, etc) use different ranges and
78828>>>>>>>    // different steps. Everything above iTopVal is removed and everything that is not
78828>>>>>>>    // within the iStep range is removed.
78828>>>>>>>    Function PrintFlagRange Integer iTopVal Integer iStep Returns Integer
78830>>>>>>>        Integer iFgs iFg
78830>>>>>>>        Get DFGetPrintDialogFlags to iFg
78831>>>>>>>        Move (mod(iFg,iTopVal) / iStep * iStep ) to iFg
78832>>>>>>>        Function_Return iFg
78833>>>>>>>    End_Function
