79067>>>>>    Function Output_Device_Mode Returns Integer
79069>>>>>        Integer hoId
79069>>>>>        String DevMode
79069>>>>>        Get Private.Output_Device_Mode to DevMode
79070>>>>>        If (DevMode=PRINT_TO_UNDEFINED) Begin
79072>>>>>            Get Report_View_Id to hoId
79073>>>>>            If hoID ;                Get OutPut_Device_Mode of hoID to DevMode
79076>>>>>            If (DevMode=PRINT_TO_UNDEFINED) ;                Move PRINT_TO_WINDOW to DevMode
79079>>>>>        End
79079>>>>>>
79079>>>>>        Function_Return DevMode
79080>>>>>    End_Function
