79085>>>>>    
79085>>>>>    // displays a metric ruler in .5 increments. This can be
79085>>>>>    // sent to make it easy to see how fields and labels should
79085>>>>>    // be moved for alignment.
79085>>>>>    //
79085>>>>>    Procedure ShowRuler
79087>>>>>        Integer i
79087>>>>>        Number n
79087>>>>>        For i from 0 to 30
79093>>>>>>
79093>>>>>            Send DFWritePos of (phoWinPrint(Self)) (String(i)) FONT_DEFAULT i -1 0
79094>>>>>            Move (i+.5) to n
79095>>>>>            Send DFWritePos of (phoWinPrint(Self)) "." FONT_DEFAULT n -1 0
79096>>>>>        Loop
79097>>>>>>
79097>>>>>        Send DFWriteLn of (phoWinPrint(Self)) ''  FONT_DEFAULT FONT_DEFAULT -1
79098>>>>>    End_Procedure
