79109>>>>>    Procedure Start_Status
79111>>>>>        Integer eMode
79111>>>>>        String sTitle sCaption
79111>>>>>        Get Output_device_mode to eMode
79112>>>>>        If (eMode=PRINT_TO_WINDOW) Begin
79114>>>>>            Get Report_Caption to sCaption
79115>>>>>            Get Report_Title to sTitle
79116>>>>>            If (sTitle<>"" and sCaption<>"") Begin
79118>>>>>                Move ( sCaption- ":" * sTitle) to sTitle
79119>>>>>            End
79119>>>>>>
79119>>>>>            Else Begin
79120>>>>>                Move (sCaption - sTitle) to sTitle
79121>>>>>            End
79121>>>>>>
79121>>>>>            Send SetReportTitle of (phoWinPrint(Self)) sTitle
79122>>>>>        End
79122>>>>>>
79122>>>>>        Else Begin
79123>>>>>            Forward Send Start_status
79125>>>>>        End
79125>>>>>>
79125>>>>>    End_Procedure
