79148>>>>>    Function Report_Interrupt Returns Integer
79150>>>>>        Integer eStat
79150>>>>>        String sMess
79150>>>>>        Boolean bActiveViewer
79150>>>>>        Get IsViewerActive to bActiveViewer
79151>>>>>        If (Error_Check_State(Self)) Begin
79153>>>>>            Move C_$AnErrorWishToCancel to sMess
79154>>>>>        End
79154>>>>>>
79154>>>>>        Else Begin
79155>>>>>            Move  C_$CancelThisReport to sMess
79156>>>>>        End
79156>>>>>>
79156>>>>>        If bActiveViewer Begin
79158>>>>>            Get PreviewYesNoBox of (phoWinPrint(Self)) C_$ReportInterrupt sMess to eStat
79159>>>>>        End
79159>>>>>>
79159>>>>>        Else Begin
79160>>>>>            Move (YesNo_Box(sMess, C_$ReportInterrupt, MB_DEFBUTTON1)) to eStat
79161>>>>>        End
79161>>>>>>
79161>>>>>        
79161>>>>>        Function_Return (eStat=MBR_YES)
79162>>>>>        
79162>>>>>    End_Function
