79163>>>>>    Function Test_KeyPressed Returns Integer
79165>>>>>        Boolean bStop bError bActiveViewer
79165>>>>>        Integer eMode
79165>>>>>        // winreport will do this also, but this makes sure that this gets called
79165>>>>>        // for each body loop -- even if the body loop prints nothing
79165>>>>>        Send PumpMsgQueue of (phoWinPrint(Self)) // permit painting
79166>>>>>        Get IsViewerActive to bActiveViewer
79167>>>>>        Get Output_device_mode to eMode
79168>>>>>        If bActiveViewer Begin
79170>>>>>            Get ViewerWantsToClose of (phoWinPrint(Self)) to bStop
79171>>>>>            Get Error_Check_State to bError
79172>>>>>            If (bStop or bError) Begin
79174>>>>>                Get Report_Interrupt to bStop
79175>>>>>            End
79175>>>>>>
79175>>>>>        End
79175>>>>>>
79175>>>>>        Else Begin
79176>>>>>            Forward Get Test_KeyPressed to bStop
79178>>>>>            If (eMode=PRINT_TO_WINDOW and not(bStop)) Begin
79180>>>>>                Send DfPreviewNoWait
79181>>>>>            End
79181>>>>>>
79181>>>>>        End
79181>>>>>>
79181>>>>>        
79181>>>>>        Function_Return bStop
79182>>>>>    End_Function
